==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*4 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Summon a [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] when the LeMurr spawns. Can Can should be able to defeat LeMurr rather quickly. When you have the cash, spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. At lv30, Awakened Bahamut will be able to one-shot the Gory Dark that spawns. With no more threats, your two cats should be able to destroy the base in a matter of seconds.

